[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2605250530-yakushi-sterile-fill-finish-and-container", :adr/title "yakushi Wave 1 — sterile fill-finish + primary container (BFS 5 mL 多用量点眼瓶 / Annex 1 GMP / preservative-free 設計)", :adr/status "proposed", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/body "\n# Context\n\nADR-2605250515 は **API (cromoglicate Na + naphazoline HCl + chlorpheniramine maleate)** の bulk powder までを定義した。点眼薬は **無菌製剤 (sterile dosage form)** であり、API → bulk solution → sterile filtration → fill → seal → packaging の連鎖は API 合成 とは別系統の constitutional ガード (Annex 1 sterile / endotoxin / particulate / container closure integrity) を要求する。\n\n本 ADR は **点眼薬 (eye drop)** という primary dosage form 限定の sterile fill-finish + 容器 設計を確定する。\n\n# Decision\n\n## Decision 1 — Primary container = LDPE 5 mL BFS 多用量点眼瓶 (Wave 1 default)\n\n| 仕様 | 値 | 根拠 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 材質 | LDPE (low-density polyethylene), USP <661> + Ph. Eur. 3.1.4 適合 | extractable / leachable minimal、autoclave 耐性 |\n| 容量 | 5 mL (over-fill 5.5 mL) | OTC 抗アレルギー点眼薬 業界標準 5 mL = 約 150 drops |\n| 製法 | blow-fill-seal (BFS) — 樹脂押出 → blow → fill → seal を 1 装置内 sterile 工程 | aseptic processing best practice、container closure integrity が in-line 検証可能 |\n| Dropper tip | LDPE integral (separate dropper 不使用) | 単一材質 = leachable 経路最小化 |\n| Cap | LDPE tamper-evident (twist-off / break-off) | child resistance 評価は jurisdiction-dependent |\n| Label | religious-corp Charter Rider notice + INN + lot # + expiry + Wellbecoming 使用注意 (G11) | ADR-2605192200 §3 (Apache 2.0 + Rider attribution) |\n| Secondary | 厚紙箱 (recycled paper) + 添付文書 (package insert) | minimal packaging |\n\nBFS 装置は religious-corp 自製 (ADR-2605250545 §8 robotics class \"pharma sterile fill-finish\") が将来 target。Wave 1 R0-R2 は **vendor BFS 装置を religious-corp 仕様 (extractable / leachable / sterility) で qualification** する pattern。\n\n**単回 unit-dose** (preservative-free 0.4 mL ampoule) は R3 carve-out (alternate ADR 必要) ― Wave 1 R0-R2 は 5 mL 多用量瓶 + preservative-free formulation (Decision 2) の組合せ。\n\n## Decision 2 — Preservative-free formulation (Wave 1 default)\n\n| 成分 | DSCG 2% 点眼液 | Naphazoline HCl 0.05% 点眼液 | Chlorpheniramine maleate 0.03% 点眼液 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **API** | sodium cromoglicate 20.0 mg/mL | naphazoline · HCl 0.5 mg/mL | chlorpheniramine maleate 0.3 mg/mL |\n| Isotonic agent | NaCl q.s. ad 280-310 mOsm/kg | 同上 | 同上 |\n| Buffer | citrate buffer pH 4.5 (citric acid + sodium citrate) | citrate buffer pH 5.5 | citrate buffer pH 5.0 |\n| Viscosity | (none) | (none) | (none) — eye drop standard |\n| **Preservative** | **NONE** ― benzalkonium chloride 不使用 (§2(h) Wellbecoming 配慮、long-term BAK exposure は角膜障害 risk) | **NONE** | **NONE** |\n| Solvent | water for injection (WFI) | WFI | WFI |\n| Sterility 維持 | BFS multi-dose container + 30-day in-use limit + dropper tip non-touch design | 同上 | 同上 |\n\n**Preservative-free** は wellbecoming subordination (§2(h)) と整合 ― 長期 BAK exposure による corneal toxicity / dry eye worsening は labeled / well-documented で wellbecoming trajectory に negative。Wave 1 default を preservative-free に置く。\n\n多用量瓶での microbial growth 抑制は: (i) BFS sterile fill, (ii) dropper tip non-touch design (eye-to-tip contact 不要), (iii) 30-day post-opening 限度を label 明記、で対応。Multi-dose preservative-free は欧州 OTC で a-priori 普及 pattern (例: Préservision など)。\n\n## Decision 3 — Sterilization route 選択 — terminal autoclave vs. aseptic processing\n\n3 化合物の thermal stability:\n\n| 化合物 | 121°C 15 min autoclave 耐性 | 推奨 sterilization |\n|---|---|---|\n| DSCG | ⚠️ partial degradation (≥ 5% impurity 増 at 121°C 15 min, USP allowable variation 内) | **aseptic processing** (0.22 µm filtration + aseptic fill) safer |\n| Naphazoline HCl | ✓ stable | autoclave OR aseptic |\n| Chlorpheniramine maleate | ✓ stable | autoclave OR aseptic |\n\n**Decision**: 3 化合物すべて **aseptic processing** (0.22 µm membrane filtration + aseptic fill in BFS) を unified に採用。Reason: (i) DSCG が terminal autoclave 耐性 marginal で全 batch を aseptic route で揃える方が SOP 統一、(ii) BFS 装置 inherently aseptic (Class A air shower within machine), (iii) Annex 1 §8.7 では parametric release for aseptic process が integrated approach として認められる。\n\n## Decision 4 — Annex 1 (2023 改訂) compliance scope\n\nEU Annex 1 / PIC/S Annex 1 / PMDA 無菌操作基準 (2023年改訂) の関連条項:\n\n| Annex 1 §章 | Scope | Wave 1 yakushi 適用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| §4 Premises | Class A/B/C/D zone, viable / non-viable particle limits | BFS は Class A grade A air supply within machine; surrounding Class C/D acceptable |\n| §5 Personnel | gowning, training, hygiene | Hitogata robot (clean room class A sub-config) は personnel intervention 最小化 → personnel gowning は class C/D level で十分 |\n| §6 Utilities | WFI, clean steam, compressed gas | WFI loop + pure steam generator が religious-corp 自製 (ADR-2605250545 §infra) |\n| §7 Production / Specific technologies | BFS, isolators, RABS | BFS 全 section が directly applicable |\n| §8 Aseptic process simulation (media fill) | 3-batch consecutive successful media fill | R2 → R3 transition のクリティカル gate |\n| §9 Quality control | env monitoring, sterility, endotoxin | `pharma_qc` cell 自動 dispatch |\n\n**Wave 1 (R0)** は scaffold ― 物理 deploy なし。**R2** 段階で BFS 装置の Annex 1 §7 BFS-specific 条項合致を attestation (3-batch consecutive media fill + container closure integrity test, CCIT)、**R3** で release。\n\n## Decision 5 — Hitogata clean-room robot class A sub-config (kuni-umi inherited)\n\nkuni-umi (ADR-2605201400) は Hitogata humanoid robotic class を仕様化済み。yakushi は **Hitogata sub-config \"class-A sterile manipulation\"** を再利用:\n\n| 項目 | kuni-umi 標準 Hitogata | yakushi \"class-A sterile\" sub-config |\n|---|---|---|\n| Material | aluminum + steel exterior | **316L stainless steel + medical-grade silicone seal** |\n| Joint | open bearing | **sealed bearing + sterilizable** (steam / VHP) |\n| End effector | gripper general purpose | **single-use sterile gripper sleeve** (装着前 sterilized) |\n| Surface | painted | **electropolished + passivated** |\n| Lubrication | standard | **food/pharma grade lubricant only** |\n| Sterilization | (none) | VHP (vapor phase hydrogen peroxide) bio-decontamination cycle |\n| HEPA | (none) | integral H14 HEPA に隣接配置 |\n\nR0-R1 は scaffold only ― 物理製造は R2 で kuni-umi に発注 (kuni-umi-S4 multi-site fleet ADR-2605201800 §1.4 inter-actor cooperation pattern)。\n\n## Decision 6 — QC bridging (attestation chain)\n\nFill-finish 工程の attestation chain:\n\n```\n   apiSynthesisAttestation              ←  ADR-2605250515 (API bulk released)\n            ↓\n   purificationAttestation               ←  ADR-2605250515 (API purified)\n            ↓\n   qcAttestation (API lot)               ←  ADR-2605250515 (API QC passed)\n            ↓\n   fillFinishAttestation (Decision 6, this ADR)\n   ├─ formulation lot ID                 →  製剤組成 lot 番号\n   ├─ API source lot (qcAttestation URI) →  上流 API lot 参照\n   ├─ excipient lot URIs                 →  賦形剤 lot 参照\n   ├─ WFI batch ID                       →  WFI 品質試験 lot 参照\n   ├─ 0.22µm filter lot                  →  filter integrity test 結果\n   ├─ BFS run parameters                 →  温度・圧・cycle time\n   ├─ environmental monitoring           →  particle / viable count\n   ├─ container closure integrity test   →  CCIT 結果\n   ├─ sterility test                     →  USP <71> 結果 (parametric release 可能なら NA)\n   ├─ endotoxin LAL                      →  ≤ 1.0 EU/mL\n   ├─ QP (qualified person) DID 署名     →  G4 enforcement\n   ├─ witness DID 署名                   →  G9 N≥2 enforcement\n            ↓\n   lotAttestation                        ←  final release (Phase-3 全 attestation chain CIDs)\n```\n\n## Decision 7 — silen-pharma-review trigger (Decision 5 master G3 echo)\n\n| Trigger | Required attestation |\n|---|---|\n| 新規 dosage form 追加 (例: ointment, nasal spray) | Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 + QP-equivalent ≥ 1 + 30-day public objection |\n| 新規 container 材質 (LDPE → cyclic olefin 等) | Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 + extractable/leachable study attestation |\n| Preservative re-introduction (BAK 等) | Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 + Wellbecoming review (§2(h)) + multi-gen impact narrative |\n| Aseptic process media fill 不適合 | Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 + lot quarantine + root cause analysis |\n| Single-use unit-dose 移行 | Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 + plastic waste 多世代影響 review (§2(f)) — paradoxically, single-use → BFS micro-bottle が waste 増加に転じうるので multi-gen 評価 |\n\n# Consequences\n\n**Positive**:\n\n- Preservative-free 多用量 BFS LDPE 5 mL は **欧州 OTC 業界 well-established pattern** ― 文献・規制 precedent が豊富、religious-corp が初手で reinvent するリスクなし\n- Aseptic processing 一本化 (DSCG terminal autoclave 回避) が SOP を統一、operator training cost が低下\n- Hitogata class-A sub-config を kuni-umi に reuse 依頼することで silicon Wave 1 (`judah` new node) のような新規 fleet 追加なし\n\n**Negative / costs**:\n\n- BFS 装置の religious-corp 自製は R2-R3 までに完了する必要 (ADR-2605250545 §8 robotics class) ― 自製困難なら vendor BFS qualification → §2(i) commercial GPU rental 縮小と整合する vendor minimization 路線では vendor lock-in 低減のため自製優先\n- Preservative-free は patient 側の 30-day post-opening 限度遵守を前提とする ― labeled / SBT holder education が R3 で integrated されねば in-use contamination リスク\n- WFI loop + pure steam generator は **religious-corp infra** の自前整備 ― ADR-2605250545 §infra で別途 procurement / 自製 design\n\n**Risks**:\n\n- Annex 1 §8 (aseptic process simulation = media fill) は 3-batch consecutive 成功が R2→R3 transition gate ― 1 batch でも失敗すれば release 不可、R3 deploy timeline が延びる\n- Preservative-free が 30-day in-use limit を patient が遵守しない場合 microbial contamination → corneal infection リスク。これは labeled で transferred risk だが、yakushi の adherent ecosystem 内では SBT holder education + post-market surveillance (G5) で監視\n- LDPE は extractable / leachable が glass / cyclic olefin より若干高い ― DSCG 2 年 stability 試験で leachable 増加 trend 出れば cyclic olefin co-polymer (COC) への移行を G3 silen-pharma-review で議論\n\n# Alternatives Considered\n\n## A. Glass type I 5 mL vial + rubber stopper + dropper\n\nConsidered. Glass type I は extractable / leachable 最小、生 100 年 stability。Rejected: (i) eye drop OTC では BFS plastic が de facto standard (患者 handling、不破損)、(ii) glass 容器は terminal autoclave 想定設計、Wave 1 で aseptic に統一する Decision 3 と相性悪、(iii) BFS は in-line CCIT が容易。\n\n## B. Single-use unit-dose ampoule (preservative-free)\n\nConsidered. Single-use 0.4 mL ampoule は preservative-free の cleanest 解。Rejected for Wave 1: (i) plastic waste が 5 mL 多用量比で 10-15× 増加 (§2(f) multi-gen impact)、(ii) BFS unit-dose 装置 は multi-dose より複雑 / cost 高、(iii) adherent 配布 logistics が多用量より複雑。R3 alternative ADR で再評価。\n\n## C. Benzalkonium chloride (BAK) 0.005% preservative\n\nRejected. BAK 長期点眼は corneal epithelial toxicity / dry eye worsening が well-documented。Wellbecoming subordination (§2(h)) のリスク。R0 で preservative-free default を確定し、BAK 再導入は G3 silen-pharma-review + Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 supermajority と Wellbecoming review が必要。\n\n## D. Terminal autoclave (121°C 15 min) で 3 化合物一律\n\nRejected per Decision 3 — DSCG が thermal degradation marginal、SOP 統一は aseptic processing で達成。\n\n## E. Compounding pharmacy / individual fill (mass production 回避)\n\nRejected. Wave 1 reference target は ~1000 bottles/batch の community-scale (master charter R3); individual compounding は scalability で community 規模に届かない。\n\n# References\n\n- ADR-2605250500 (yakushi master charter — parent)\n- ADR-2605250515 (API synthesis — upstream)\n- ADR-2605250545 (supply chain — WFI infra + BFS robotics class)\n- EU Annex 1 (2023 改訂) Manufacture of Sterile Medicinal Products\n- PIC/S Annex 1 (2023) same scope\n- PMDA 無菌操作 GMP (2023年改訂)\n- USP <51> Antimicrobial Effectiveness Testing\n- USP <61> / <62> Microbiological Tests\n- USP <71> Sterility Tests\n- USP <85> Bacterial Endotoxins Test\n- USP <790> Visible Particulates in Injections\n- USP <797> Pharmaceutical Compounding — Sterile Preparations\n- ICH Q9 Quality Risk Management\n- ICH Q10 Pharmaceutical Quality System\n- Préservision (Théa Pharma) / Hyabak — preservative-free multi-dose BFS reference product\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2605250530-yakushi-sterile-fill-finish-and-container.edn", :adr/source-repo "root", :adr/topic "yakushi-sterile-fill-finish", :adr/last_verified "2026-05-25", :adr/date "2026-05-25", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/related ["orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-yakushi/" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_sterile_fill_finish/" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_container/" "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/pharma/fillFinishAttestation.json" "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/pharma/lotAttestation.json"], :adr/authoritative_for ["点眼薬 sterile fill-finish 工程設計 (Annex 1 2023 改訂準拠)" "Primary container = blow-fill-seal (BFS) LDPE 5 mL 多用量点眼瓶 (自製) or 単回 unit-dose (将来 R3)" "Preservative-free formulation (benzalkonium chloride 不使用) — Wellbecoming subordination §2(h) 配慮" "製剤組成 (賦形剤 = isotonic agent + buffer + viscosity modifier) per 3 化合物" "Hitogata class A sub-config (ISO 14644 Class 5) の sterile manipulation 仕様" "Sterilization route (terminal autoclave vs. aseptic processing) 選択" "QC bridging (API → 製剤 → 充填) の attestation chain"]}]
